WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Falcomon's With Us?!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Rage, Blossomon!

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.840
Falcomon's With Us?!

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.550
Rage, Blossomon!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:18.190
After Diving into the Digital World, Masaru and the others made their way towards Infinity Ice Ridge, where Mercurimon resided.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:21.570
Along the way, they encountered MetalPhantomon, who blocked their path.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:27.230
In the ensuing battle, Tohma enabled Gaomon to evolve into his Perfect form, MachGaogamon.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.350
Yoshino!

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.910
38.8 degrees Celsius.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:58.150
NOTE: About 102 degrees Fahrenheit.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:58.150
That's a bad fever!

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:00.970
We'd better take her to some place where she can rest.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.390
I'm all right...

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:06.510
We have to... get to Infinity Ice Ridge...

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:07.410
Yoshino-san!

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.020
Yoshino!

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.140
Hey! Yoshino!

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.430
Yoshino!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:19.000
Why I am the only one who's forced to wait out here?

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.740
He's a nasty guy to leave Aniki out of things!

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.810
Miss Yoshino is a woman.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.310
It's only natural for us to give her some modesty.

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:28.590
Then Tohma should be out here, too!

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:30.940
Aniki, don't suddenly stop like that!

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:32.940
Master has a medical license.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.700
A medical license?

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:37.100
How the hell did he get that when he's the same age as me?!

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:37.820
He was a special exception.

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:42.320
Man, he pisses me off, that damn superhuman!

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:45.120
I have a wound. Can I come in?

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:45.990
No.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.340
She must have accumulated stress ever since we got here.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.600
That's what I thought.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:57.930
Yoshino always works herself too hard...

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:01.680
Drink lots of water and rest. We'll stay here for tonight.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.120
You can't...

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.640
We still have... our mission...

00:03:07.570 --> 00:03:09.350
It's not just for you.

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:14.770
That stamina freak and I need to rest as well.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:16.980
"Stamina freak..."

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.040
Besides...

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.460
Looks like she fell asleep.

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:27.760
Speaking of which, I can't hear Masaru's voice anymore.

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:28.580
Yeah.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.260
It's suspiciously quiet.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:36.000
Master!

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.410
Where are Masaru and Agumon?

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:41.530
It looked like they were heading towards the river.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.480
Oh man, I told them not to wander off...

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:47.970
Lalamon, we're going to see where Masaru is. Watch over Yoshino-san for us.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:49.230
Got it.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.000
Let's go, Gaomon.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:51.860
Yes, Master.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.480
This feels great, Aniki!

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:04.240
Hey, help me collect water!

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:06.980
We can't let Tohma take the credit for everythi-

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:10.120
Aniki's a wet chicken!

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.200
You little twerp!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.730
If it's a fight you want, you've got one!

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:15.830
Aniki! Aniki, don't-

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:19.210
You're the one who splashed me first!

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.410
Masaru.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.330
Masaru!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.010
Stop bothering me!

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:28.890
Well, these two don't look like they need a break.

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:29.680
Indeed...

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:44.600
Welco-...

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:46.900
Yoshino!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.250
Lalamon...

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.040
What...?

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.090
Are you alone?

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.620
Human enemy!

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.670
Get out of Digital World!

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.660
Get her, Ikuto!

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.030
Yoshino!

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:12.210
Bastard, how dare you make a move on a sick person and call that being a man!

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:15.660
Men don't use their fists to attack those...

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.890
who are weaker than themselves!

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:23.070
Stop it.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.140
What did you do?!

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.330
Ikuto!

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.630
Hey, Ikuto!

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:48.810
Ikuto...

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.510
Damn it...

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:55.930
You've given the virus to Ikuto!

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:57.820
Virus?

00:05:57.820 --> 00:05:59.100
Do you know something about this?

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.440
Shut up!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.980
They just came and went as they pleased.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:18.940
What was he saying about an "eerus?"

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.480
Virus.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.390
It's a disease-producing agent.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:23.140
Yoshino!

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.630
Now it's 39.5 degrees Celsius and rising!

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.630
NOTE: About 103 degrees Fahrenheit.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:33.060
Why didn't I notice this before?

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.600
What do you mean by that? Make yourself clear!

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:38.770
Yoshino-san isn't merely sick due to stress.

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:43.270
There's a possibility that she's been infected with an unknown illness from the Digital World.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:44.940
What did you say?!

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:49.950
Falcomon... how's enemy?

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:52.090
Never mind that. Have a good sleep.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.160
I'm okay...

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:58.390
Ikuto...

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.660
You'll get better, right?

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.500
You'll definitely get better, right?

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:08.460
After all, we were able to save you back then...

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.860
Not good... the illness is spreading.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:19.810
Hey, Tohma...

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:23.120
Aren't you a doctor? Hurry up and cure her!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:24.070
A vaccine.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.480
If I want to cure her, I'll need the correct vaccine that counters the virus.

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:32.450
In other words, I need a medicine made specifically for the disease...

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:37.110
But I can't make it when I don't even know what type of virus it is.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:38.990
So... if that "buncine" thing...

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:40.060
Vaccine.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:42.660
Whatever it is!

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:45.630
If you don't make a vaccine, what'll happen?

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.630
W-Well...

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.160
The worst-case scenario is...

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.380
we won't be able to save Yoshino.

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:56.340
Right?

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:57.510
Damn it!

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:59.480
Don't you even dare to think that!

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:03.770
Judging by the severity of her condition and the rate it's spreading...

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:06.480
Damn it!

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.940
What are we supposed to do?

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.450
Ikuto...

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.460
Get better!

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.580
It's okay... You'll be fine soon.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:25.060
It's okay, he'll be fine soon!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.600
Take care of Ikuto for me.

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.370
Yukidarumon!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.660
Why are you always so concerned with Ikuto anyway?

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:39.990
He always gets sick and he can't do anything!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:44.580
You're a good boy, this much I'm sure of.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.820
If you don't come back, I'll...

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.840
I'll go to Wanderer's Cape myself!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:52.660
No!

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:54.840
That place is desecrated.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:58.110
It's all right. I'll be back soon.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.410
Looks like I've no choice but to go...

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.630
...to Wanderer's Cape.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:14.550
Hey, Gaomon, what does "sick" mean? Is it as bad as being hungry?

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:17.830
It's something that threatens the life of a living thing.

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:19.490
Living?

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.060
Oh!

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:24.030
So you're not able to eat fried eggs anymore!

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.810
It's not just fried eggs.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:29.700
That's really bad! What can we do so she can eat fried eggs again?

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:30.860
I don't know.

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:33.210
But I'm sure Master will come up with something.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.650
That's a waste of energy!

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:38.600
In order to cure this illness,

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.070
you have to go to Wanderer's Cape!

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:42.380
You!

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:43.340
What do you mean?

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:47.230
The symptoms are the same.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.980
They most likely have the same virus.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:53.650
Didn't I just tell you that? She passed the virus to Ikuto!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.200
Is it true what you said?

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:59.180
That we'll get the vaccine from that Wanderer's Cape place?

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:03.490
I want to save Ikuto, too! Why would I lie?

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.600
Then why don't you go by yourself?

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:07.390
Th-That's because...

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:10.400
That place has been desecrated.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:11.810
Desecrated?

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:14.380
Humans used to live there.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:18.030
That's why we Digimon are uncomfortable going there and no one dares to approach it.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.700
Hang on, you said humans...!

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:22.490
Like Professor Daimon?

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:26.550
How would I know? Everyone always told me not to go there, so I never have.

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:30.000
But if humans like you went, it should be all right.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.560
I don't know how far I should trust you.

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:39.350
I trust him.

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:43.790
I don't think he's lying.

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:44.570
Please!

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:46.640
Go together and save Yoshino!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.750
Let's go, Tohma.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.280
There's no other way.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.310
Yes, Master.

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:53.100
Yeah!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.330
We'll let you lead the way.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:02.410
We have to hurry. The illness is still spreading.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:03.920
Can we make it in a day's time?

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:05.990
We definitely will.

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:07.450
Lalamon, take care of the rest.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.180
Okay. Be careful, everyone.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:14.830
Don't worry, I'll look after the boy well.

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:17.610
Follow me!

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:17.960
Hey!

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:19.910
Don't order us around!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.970
Hey, you said there were humans at Wanderer's Cape...

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.470
Where are they now?

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:37.790
I don't know.

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:40.020
Do you know anyone who does?

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:42.690
Yukidarumon might've known.

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:44.700
So, could you ask that person for us?

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:46.490
I can't.

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:48.220
Why not?

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.380
She's dead...

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:54.460
I thought death didn't exist for Digimon...

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:00.380
Sorry about that.

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:03.340
This is why I hate humans!

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.130
Sorry...

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:09.560
Master!

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:11.850
Look over there.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:18.390
So that's Wanderer's Cape.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.780
The humans have gone to Wanderer's Cape?

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:25.420
Yes!

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:26.140
What...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.000
What should we do, my lord?

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:29.120
Let them go.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:30.380
But...

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:31.830
But Mercurimon-sama!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.790
I said, let them go!

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.750
Y-Yes, sir!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:39.740
Really...

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:41.640
Really, I don't understand...

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.690
Mercurimon-sama...

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.550
What is he thinking?

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.680
You look rather perplexed, Gotsumon.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:50.760
Oh! Blossomon!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:58.070
We can't let the humans wander around the Digital World as if they own it...

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:01.210
nor the impudent Digimon who betray us.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.980
They must be punished severely.

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:06.470
Reliable! You are truly reliable, Blossomon!

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:12.660
Just let them have a taste of my beautiful techniques.

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:21.130
How did it become like this?

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:24.340
Master, this place smells awfully dangerous.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:26.450
We go in here, right?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:27.960
I... I don't know.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:30.010
This is my first time here.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:32.140
What, are you scared?

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:33.310
No, I'm not!

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:34.560
I knew it, you're scared!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:35.390
I am not!

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:38.150
Now's not the time to be playing around!

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:38.780
Let's go!

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:39.310
Right.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:47.040
What the hell, there's nothing special inside here.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.850
Don't let your guard down.

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:54.650
It seems this place has been deserted for years.

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:57.500
Sure must've been hard keeping it clean.

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:01.130
Master.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.590
That's quite an old-looking PC.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.280
I guess this proves humans were here once.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.200
But I don't know if it'll work.

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:11.460
It works!

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:14.050
Password, huh?

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.600
Doesn't look good...

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:19.310
Maybe there's something about my dad in there!

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:20.000
Yeah.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:22.540
Hang on.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.230
Now's not the time to be doing this! We need that vaccine!

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:27.100
I know!

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:28.990
Tohma, we'll let you handle things here.

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:29.500
Sure.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.080
What?

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.160
Is this the kitchen?

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:35.740
That's...!

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:38.140
The box where Sayuri keeps her fried eggs!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.080
What's this?

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:43.070
It's not eggs.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:44.040
That's it!

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:49.670
This is the vaccine?

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:54.450
Yeah. It's the same one that Yukidarumon gave to Ikuto before.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.140
This thing, huh?

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:56.430
Sorry, little boy!

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.970
Aniki! The vaccine...!

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:02.270
Hang on, you bastard!

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:08.060
A virus made out of digital data shouldn't have been able to infect a human.

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:10.150
But it still did, nonetheless...

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:12.360
Master...

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:14.200
Damn...

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.280
Why does this have such tight security?

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:32.010
Blossomon

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:32.010
Perfect Level

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.060
Blossomon.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.620
A Perfect Level Digimon.

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:28.430
His special attack is Spiral Flower.

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:32.010
He uses his flowers like shuriken to extend and cut anything, no matter how hard it is.

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:37.010
Falcomon, your betrayal has made Mercurimon-sama very angry.

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.850
No! I was...!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:41.850
Be quiet! I'll punish you well.

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:48.930
You... protected me?

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:50.020
Of course!

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:51.220
We're comrades.

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:54.990
H-Hey!

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:59.450
That medicine is important! Give it back!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:05.910
Not bad!

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:14.430
You...

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:18.350
I'm not doing this for you guys, but for Ikuto!

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.030
Aniki!

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:25.260
This is annoying! You guys are making me angry!

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:27.480
Bird!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:28.520
Go ahead of us!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:33.700
You don't have the luxury of wasting time here!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:37.990
I'm sorry, Lalamon.

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:42.300
I've given everyone so much trouble lately.

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:43.910
That's not true!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:48.170
I wish... I was stronger...

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:49.640
Yes.

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:50.760
Me, too.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.130
Baby Flame!

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.500
What are you doing? Get going, Bird!

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.660
Why do you trust me?

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.670
This medicine is the only one there is!

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:06.900
I could betray you and let Ikuto have it all to himself!

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.080
If you don't know, then I'll tell you.

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.730
Men never betray their friends!

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.390
You're a man!

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:18.640
You've mustered what little courage you had to take us this far,

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.770
and that makes you a man among men!

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:23.410
That's why I trust you!

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.210
Where are you going?

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:32.060
Your opponent is me!

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.120
Me, too!

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:37.030
A Digimon who pairs himself with a human should suffer this!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.720
Spiral Flower!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:44.230
Master!

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.300
Master, are you all right?

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:51.040
Yeah...

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:54.450
Our important lead!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.220
You're being too full of yourself.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.700
Aniki!

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.820
Baby Fla-...!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.500
Give it up.

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:13.980
You... What are you still doing here?!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:14.360
But...!

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.480
Idiot!

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:17.550
We're fine. Just go!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:19.670
Got it!

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:22.260
I'm not letting you escape!

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.090
Double Backhand!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:28.680
Tohma!

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:29.350
Gaomon!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.240
Sorry, Masaru!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.100
That guy destroyed the computer!

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:34.170
What?!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.470
Serves you right.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:36.820
Damn it!

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:38.340
Master!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.440
Let's go, Gaomon.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.420
Digisoul...

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:48.370
Full Charge!

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:53.170
Gaomon, evolve!

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:13.570
MachGaogamon!

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:15.270
Go!

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.230
You two are impertinent as well!

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:32.670
MachGaogamon!

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:33.370
Thanks!

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:40.350
You bastard!

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:45.340
What?!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.260
Digisoul...

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:56.370
Full Charge!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:19:59.480
Aniki!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:01.880
Agumon, evolve!

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:20.940
RiseGreymon!

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:24.840
RiseGreymon!

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.310
Unforgivable! Extremely unforgivable!

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:32.020
Spiral Flower!

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.340
That's useless against me now!

00:20:34.340 --> 00:20:36.100
Trident Revolver!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.090
N-N-No!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.170
We're back!

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:54.370
How is Yoshino-san?

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:55.980
Shh!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.180
Keep quiet.

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:59.550
Her fever's finally begun to go down.

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:02.050
Where are Ikuto and Falcomon?

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:02.550
It can't be...

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:06.260
Falcomon gave Yoshino the medicine first.

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:07.970
Is that so...

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.010
Didn't I say so?

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.810
That guy's a man.

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:13.980
Geez...

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:15.270
You're quite a character...

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:20.320
Ikuto, are you awake?

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.950
You're okay now, thanks to them!

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:25.370
Falcomon, they human.

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:27.150
Get revenge for Yukidarumon.

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.380
I know.

