<b>ENDING THEME 

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:38.140
Yoshino.

00:22:38.140 --> 00:22:39.960
Don't keep your thoughts all to yourself,

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:43.380
because I'll always be by your side.

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:47.440
Remember the day when we first met?

00:22:47.440 --> 00:22:52.390
I was called to the human world by the sweet melody of your piano.

00:22:52.390 --> 00:22:53.720
Please, Yoshino!

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:55.200
Remember!

00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:56.660
